 of the water tank together with the ambient temperature data (which can determine the possibility of freezing of the water pipe, measured by the temperature sensor) and (if the pump abnormality can be determined) preferably, a current sensor is further provided to control the pump using the current data supplied to the pump"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100901209-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "for example, in one winter, a low temperature can cause freezing of a water pipe that supplies water from a water reservoir to a drain"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100901209-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "for example, in one winter, a low temperature can cause freezing of a water pipe that supplies water from a water reservoir to a drain"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100901209-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "according to this aspect of the present invention, the water supply control device checks the outside air temperature sensed by the temperature sensor and intermittently drives the pump to prevent freezing of the water supply pipe supplying water to the water tank of the drain"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100901209-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "according to this aspect of the present invention, the water supply control device checks the outside air temperature sensed by the temperature sensor and intermittently drives the pump to prevent freezing of the water supply pipe supplying water to the water tank of the drain"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100901209-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "according to this aspect of the present invention, the water supply control device checks the outside air temperature sensed by the temperature sensor and intermittently drives the pump to prevent freezing of the water supply pipe supplying water to the water tank of the drain"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100901209-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "according to this aspect of the present invention, the water supply control device checks the outside air temperature sensed by the temperature sensor and intermittently drives the pump to prevent freezing of the water supply pipe supplying water to the water tank of the drain"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100901209-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "that is, when the outside air temperature falls below the reference value through the temperature sensor 270, the water supply control device 200 intermittently drives the pump 220 to prevent freezing of the water supply pipe 230"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100901209-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "that is, when the outside air temperature falls below the reference value through the temperature sensor 270, the water supply control device 200 intermittently drives the pump 220 to prevent freezing of the water supply pipe 230"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100991888-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "thus, the controller c opens the first opening / closing valve v\u2081 and simultaneously shuts off the second opening / closing valve v2 when the temperature sensor 13 detects the expected temperature of the freezing wave"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100991888-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "thus, the controller c opens the first opening / closing valve v\u2081 and simultaneously shuts off the second opening / closing valve v2 when the temperature sensor 13 detects the expected temperature of the freezing wave"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101194148-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "if the temperature is lowered, the outdoor temperature may not directly affect the water tank, thus delaying the freezing time"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101244452-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the heater unit 600 serves to prevent damage to the pipeline 510 due to volume expansion caused by freezing and freezing of the fire fighting water in the pipeline 510 due to the influence of low temperature in the winter season"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101244452-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "when the heater 610 of the heater unit 600 is disposed in the conduit 510 as in one embodiment of the present invention, the heater 610 is directly in contact with the fire water in the conduit 510, and the heater 610 can directly heat the fire water in the conduit 510, the heating efficiency and energy utilization efficiency of the fire water in the conduit 510 is excellent, thereby freezing the fire water in the conduit 510 quickly it can be heated to the above temperature"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101255061-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "receiving temperature information of the water flowing through the water pipe from the smart water meter, receiving outdoor temperature information from the meteorological server, and determining whether a water meter is in danger of freezing in accordance with the temperature information of the water in the water pipes and the outside temperature information, if the water meter determines that there is a risk of freezing waves, it provides a freeze prevention system of the water meter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101255061-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "is provided with outdoor temperature information from the water pipes, and judges whether the water meter is in danger of freezing in accordance with the water temperature information of the water pipes and the outside temperature information, and if it is determined that the water meter is in danger of freezing, to the user wire / wireless terminal of the water meter it provides a management server, characterized in that to send a freezing warning"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101289929-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the controller 14 may be provided with information on the temperature of the water in the water pipe detected by the temperature detection sensor 12, and determine the freezing time of the water in the water pipe by grasping the temperature change of the water"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101423708-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "10-0926266.the present invention relates to a water meter which is capable of reducing the expansion pressure caused by the freezing of the interior of a winter casing having a low temperature in a prior art water meter, thereby remarkably decreasing the functionality and 