ment of the present invention, the freezing wave prediction zion sheet 150 is a water meter 100 in order to change color based on the temperature of tap water passing through the fluid passage hole 111"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102158188-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "7, in the freezing wave prediction water meter system according to an embodiment of the present invention, the freezing wave prediction zion sheet 150 is color based on the temperature of the tap water passing through the fluid passage hole 111"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102193417-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the control unit determines whether or not a heating wire that is mounted inside the lower frame of the main body and prevents freezing of the side channel using the temperature measurement value and the humidity measurement value measured by the temperature sensor and the humidity sensor is driven"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102193417-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in the step of determining whether the heating wire is driven by the control unit (s200), the control unit of the freezing prevention system determines whether the heating wire 300 is driven using a temperature measurement value, a humidity measurement value measured by a temperature sensor, a humidity sensor, etc"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102193417-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "here, the temperature measurement value and the humidity measurement value transmitted through the data connection line 510 from the temperature sensor and the humidity sensor are compared with the temperature threshold value and the humidity threshold value, respectively, and the temperature measurement value is less than the temperature threshold value, and the humidity measurement value if it is determined that there is a risk of freezing or freezing above this humidity threshold, it is determined to drive the heating wire"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102332096-B1", "para_id": "para_7", "text": "in this way, when the hot air blower is driven (by driving the heater 20 and the fan 30) to generate and blow hot air, the indoor temperature is measured through the temperature sensor 10, and the measured indoor temperature is above the freezing prevention safety temperature"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102344740-B1", "para_id": "para_10", "text": "maintaining the temperature of the purified water flowing into and stored in the purified water tank unit 1100 by the anti-freezing heater unit 1600 at any one temperature selected from the range of 27 to 75 degrees celsius is to promote the activation of the advanced oxidation process (aop)"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102466363-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in general, when the outside temperature drops below freezing, such as in winter, the water flowing inside the main body of the water meter freezes and expands, and the expansion force may cause a freeze phenomenon that damages the glass cover of the meter or damages the meter itself"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102498793-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "in the heating element 40, the temperature sensor 64 installed in the water supply pipe detects the temperature of the water supply pipe, transmits the detected information to the controller box 60, and the controller box analyzes the detected information to determine the prediction of freezing and bursting"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200310444-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, the present invention, by simply installing the device around the water pipe and connecting only the power supply, the sensor detects that the temperature drops to sub-zero temperatures and heats the heating sheet to prevent freezing phenomenon that the water pipe freezes or freezes in winter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200387639-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "on the other hand, warm geothermal heat is introduced in the winter season, so that the temperature inside the water meter protector can maintain a temperature similar to that of the geothermal temperature, thereby preventing freezing of water meters and the like"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200415979-Y1", "para_i