  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "EP-1218293-B1", "para_id": "para_9", "text": "also, the air-cooler 25 will ensure that incoming raw water cannot be heated within the heat exchanger 18 to a temperature which would induce premature precipitation of dissolved solids in the incoming raw water, and thus lead to ultimate blockage inside the heat exchanger"}, {"pat_id": "EP-1228003-B1", "para_id": "para_9", "text": "also, the air-cooler 25 will ensure that incoming raw water cannot be heated within the heat exchanger 18 to a temperature which would induce premature precipitation of dissolved solids in the incoming raw water, and thus lead to ultimate blockage inside the heat exchanger"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101368425-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "at this time, the first cover 20 and the second cover 30 is provided to cover the opening of the water tank 10 to prevent the inflow of foreign matter and infiltration of bacteria in the air, the first cover 20 the space between the second cover 30 serves as a thermal insulation space to block the influence of the external temperature of the water tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101368425-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "as such, the first cover 200 covers the opening of the water tank 100 to prevent the inflow of foreign substances and the penetration of bacteria in the air, and the space between the first cover 200 and the second cover 300 is it functions as an insulated space to block the influence of the outside temperature of the water tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101583008-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "1, the bimetal 23 or 23 the heater power is directly applied to the steam generating part 20 and the power is not applied to the bimetal 23 or 23 so that the bimetal 23 or 23 can not function as a temperature sensor, accordingly, the bimetal 23 or 23 can not block the input of the heater power when the steam generating part 20 overheats, and thus the steam thawing device can not be operated safely"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200383900-Y1", "para_