installed in the car wash section (10) of the car wash, there is an effect of resolving the problem of overload caused by rainwater flowing into the wastewater storage tank (30)"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102747240-B1", "para_id": "para_5", "text": "therefore, to block the inflow of rainwater into the wastewater storage tank (30), the above-described rainwater inflow prevention device (100) is installed in the middle of the wastewater inlet pipe (40)"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102747240-B1", "para_id": "para_5", "text": "therefore, to block the inflow of rainwater into the wastewater storage tank (30), the above-described rainwater inflow prevention device (100) is installed in the middle of the wastewater inlet pipe (40)"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102773372-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "seals the rainwater receiving chamber (420) with the buoyancy of the rainwater (c), thereby blocking the fluid inflow into the casing (100)"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102805058-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the grating equipped with a cover to open and close normally maintains the drainage hole blocked by the cover, and when rainwater flows in, the cover rotates to block the drainage hole, thereby achieving the purpose"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102805058-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "wherein the rotating part of an opening/closing cover that blocks a drain hole of a trap body is formed higher than the opening/closing part, thereby preventing the rotating part from being submerged in rainwater during the rainwater draining process"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102822205-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "an experiment conducted by the national disaster and safety research institute found that when a rainwater drain is blocked by trash or covered with rubber sheets, the flooded area increases three times and the flood depth increases by more than 2.3 times"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102897725-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "and rainwater (2) is completed, thereby blocking the inlet (11)"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102897725-B1", "para_id":