57-B1", "para_id": "para_4", "text": "therefore, in the filtration device of the second embodiment including the ball top valve 35 of the above embodiment, when the level of rainwater filled in the upper portion of the horizontal blocking plate 31 is low or there is no rainwater, the buoyant elevation part 353 descends, the lifting valve plate 352 is lowered to block the lower portion of the vertical pipe 34"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102882673-B1", "para_id": "para_6", "text": "and the lifting grating (50) described above is formed below the upper surface of the grid plate (60a), thereby minimizing the accumulation of various sediments such as cigarette butts and fallen leaves around the rainwater drain on the grating"}]</data>
