lysis"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102636761-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "and the flow path switching valve (85) is less than a predetermined threshold value, the scale of the number of electrolysis the amount of precipitation can be estimated to be relatively large"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102636761-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "and the flow path switching valve (85) is greater than the predetermined threshold, the amount of scale precipitation relative to the number of times of electrolysis is it can be estimated to be relatively small"}]</data>
