  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-100763800-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, if the water is confined to a certain place for a long time, the contamination is further increased by the material decomposition and material binding action, so that the water stored in the reservoir is always kept at the full water level and water flowing from the upstream through the lower part of the sluice gate"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101054375-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "and it is characterized by including a control unit to determine the state of the wastewater to control the water level of the sump, the ph and electrical conductivity and the flow rate of the reservoir, and connected to the level of the electrolytic cell and the positive and negative plates to control the electrolysis"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101383594-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "according to the variable water level screen filter according to the present invention, since the filtration position is changed according to the water level, the contact between the contaminants accumulated on the bottom of the reservoir can be effectively prevented, and the treatment efficiency of sewage can be increased"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101484891-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "thus, until the water level from the bottom of the reservoir 200 reaches the height h4 of the highest part in the u shape reversed to the siphon channel 295, the initial sludge contamination and when the water level is equal to or higher than h4, the flow rate-reduced manhole 300 is supplied with the excellent initial point contamination until the water level from the bottom surface of the reservoir 200 becomes h3"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102087796-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "according to one disclosure, in block 102, the sewage water level adjusting apparatus 100 may calculate the rate of increase of the amount of sewage introduced into the first intermediate reservoir and the amount of introduced sewage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102087796-B1", "para_id"