  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "JP-2885063-B2", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in the regeneration method in which the amount of salt water up to a predetermined water level in the salt water tank is applied irrespective of the concentration, poor regeneration of the resin capacity is caused, and the process shifts to the water softening treatment without completely regenerating the capacity"}, {"pat_id": "JP-5042805-B2", "para_id": "para_21", "text": "specifically, when the water level gauge 111 detects that the water level in the contaminant removal tank 110 is higher than the specified water level, control is performed to relatively increase the amount of water transferred by the advection pump 122, and the contamination level is also increased"}, {"pat_id": "JP-5042805-B2", "para_id": "para_21", "text": "specifically, when the water level gauge 111 detects that the water level in the contaminant removal tank 110 is higher than the specified water level, control is performed to relatively increase the amount of water transferred by the advection pump 122, and the contamination level is also increased"}, {"pat_id": "KR-0137696-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "moreover, the method of checking the low water level in the water tank by using the air tank is very conventional, and it only functions to block the flow of water only when the water is almost full in the water tank, thereby making it difficult to identify the low water amount in the water tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-0137696-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "moreover, the method of checking the low water level in the water tank by using the air tank is very conventional, and it only functions to block the flow of water only when the water is almost full in the water tank, thereby making it difficult to identify the low water amount in the water tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-0167322-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, the cold air supplied to the upper side moves along the surface of the cold water storage tank