  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-100985209-B1", "para_id": "para_3", "text": "by estimating the wide water level range, it is possible to increase the reliability of controlling the water level in the water tank, and also, if an error occurs in either the pressure sensor or the angle sensor, such as leakage into the water pipe, the control device does not malfunction by the other"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100985209-B1", "para_id": "para_3", "text": "by estimating the wide water level range, it is possible to increase the reliability of controlling the water level in the water tank, and also, if an error occurs in either the pressure sensor or the angle sensor, such as leakage into the water pipe, the control device does not malfunction by the other"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100985209-B1", "para_id": "para_3", "text": "by estimating the wide water level range, it is possible to increase the reliability of controlling the water level in the water tank, and also, if an error occurs in either the pressure sensor or the angle sensor, such as leakage into the water pipe, the control device does not malfunction by the other"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101114764-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, there are advantages in that various accidents such as fire and water leakage, which may be caused by malfunction of the water level sensor, may be prevented in advance"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101676999-B1", "para_id": "para_6", "text": "therefore, according to the present invention, it is possible to monitor the state of water leakage or foreign matter introduced into the water tank 1 by monitoring the rapid change of the water level and the water quality, thereby enabling cleaner and safer water quality management"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102399563-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the remote terminal device can determine and monitor the leakage of hazardous chemicals or the discharge of wastewater in the factory based on the gate status information and the water level information of the manhole water level sensor to be described later"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102399563-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the remote terminal device can determine and monitor the leakage of hazardous chemicals or the discharge of wastewater in the factory based on the gate status information and the water level information of the manhole water level sensor to be described later"}, {"pat_id": "US-4709723-A", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "during periods of high ground water levels, this leakage enabled additional fluid to flow into the tank to compensate for the increased hydraulic pressure of surrounding ground water and water saturated soil"}, {"pat_id": "US-9709431-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in this example, if the rain sensor indicates that there is no local precipitation, but that there are water levels above a threshold, the control system 100 may track property operations to determine if there is a problematic operation that may be causing water leakage within the property"}]</data>
