  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-100633532-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in rainy weather with heavy rainfall, rainwater and sewage flowing through the rainwater and sewage inlets 23 of the manhole 10 increase, and the wear 40 formed inside the manhole 10 by the flow rate of the rainwater and sewage increased"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100720157-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "still another object of the present invention is to provide a odor prevention manhole that can catch filth flowing into the manhole, thereby blocking the source of odor, and preventing clogging of the drain hole"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100913911-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "multifunction offensive odor remover the present invention relates to a multi-functional odor removing device that prevents inflow of rainwater and sewage into the sewer of low-lying houses as well as odor blocking of the manhole, and more particularly, the lower shielding plate having a function of removing odors"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100913911-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "multifunction offensive odor remover the present invention relates to a multi-functional odor removing device that prevents inflow of rainwater and sewage into the sewer of low-lying houses as well as odor blocking of the manhole, and more particularly, the lower shielding plate having a function of removing odors"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101054283-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, the drain pipe is prevented from being blocked by the foreign matter deposited on the bottom of the manhole, thereby making it possible to smoothly drain the water"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101219791-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the non-point contaminant purification device using the purification unit according to the present invention effectively removes foreign substances piggybacked in rainwater treated in the manhole by using the purification unit, and removes a first porous separator between the first ceramic module and the first soil layer of the purification unit"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102046693-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, the odor blocking device 100 of the manhole according to the present invention can be used in different types of rain gutter holes"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200338729-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "on the other hand, if more than a certain amount of sediment accumulated in the bottom of the manhole, the movement of wastewater is blocked, so that smooth drainage is not achieved, and should be removed on a regular basis"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200416889-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, the rainwater and sewage that did not flow into the upper portion of the trench cover 31 are diverted to the manhole 20 through the boundary block, so that the rainwater and sewage that do not flow through the trench cover 31 flow into other adjacent areas"}]</data>
